# Chrome Extension Versioning

When changing Chrome extension runtime behavior, permissions, popup UI, content scripts, or background scripts:

- Bump `src/chrome-extension/manifest.json` before building or packaging.
- Update the current revision and changelog in `README.md`.
- Name the Chrome Web Store ZIP with the same version, e.g. `dist/OpenCap_DataExporter_v3.1.3.zip`.
- Rebuild the upload ZIP after the version bump so the packaged manifest matches the file name.

